  {
   "id": "ex1",
   "type": "example",
   "title": {
    "en": "Worked example"
   },
   "problem": {
    "en": "Write a program segment to check whether n is prime, and trace it for n = 21."
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "en": "boolean prime = n > 1;"
    },
    {
     "en": "for (int i = 2; i * i <= n; i++)"
    },
    {
     "en": "    if (n % i == 0) { prime = false; break; }"
    },
    {
     "en": "System.out.println(prime ? \"Prime\" : \"Not prime\");"
    },
    {
     "en": "Trace n = 21: i = 2 (21 % 2 = 1), i = 3 (21 % 3 = 0) → prime = false, break."
    }
   ],
   "answer": {
    "en": "For 21 it prints Not prime after only two iterations."
   },
   "narration": {
    "en": "Write a program segment to check whether n is prime, and trace it for n = 21."
   }
